{"title":"2006 SMT/Calculus Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4133afa636d25bf035040c8e3e5dccfc15b88303.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\int(x\\tan^{-1}x)dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"122\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_SMT/Calculus_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using integration by parts, we find that the desired integral is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b7679a36a36f7580efe344560b6f822457add1a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\int(x\\tan^{-1}x)dx &amp;= \\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan^{-1}x-\\int\\frac{x^2}{2(x^2+1)}dx\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{x^2}{x^2+1}dx\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\left(1-\\frac{1}{x^2+1}\\right)dx\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int 1 dx + \\int\\frac{-1}{x^2+1}dx\\right)\\\\ &amp;=\\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(x+\\cot^{-1}x \\right)\\\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"456\" height=\"236\" />\n</p><p>Therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a925ebc264669f517bdb78cd7c2d1aa2991866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{x^2}{2}\\tan^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\left(x+\\cot^{-1}x \\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"236\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016225042\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 997/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18007:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016225042 and revision id 114747. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}